WEBVTT

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.840
Onii-chan, want some candy?

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.480
Oh, thank you.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:11.110
Enryuu-sensei, thanks for 
letting me tag along, too!

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:14.990
My villa's huge, so one more person
won't be an issue.

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.240
Little sister! Little sister!

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:21.250
The summer festival we're 
going to today looks like this.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:21.250
<b>Cool Evening
 Fireworks Display</b>

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:23.380
Wow, that looks amazing.

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.500
Oh, and there's a fireworks display, too, huh?

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.070
Wow.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.140
What?

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.400
Be prepared!

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.010
I'm going to uncover your 
secret on this trip for sure!

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.520
What makes you think I've even got a secret?

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:47.520
Because you're obviously hiding something.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.410
That's not an answer.

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:52.280
I'm asking you <i>why</i> you 
think I'm hiding something.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.740
I need to know <i>everything </i>
about Towano Chikai-sensei,

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.030
so it's a natural presumption.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:00.800
<i>There must be a reason behind it.</i>

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:04.040
<i>For one thing, she's not the type
to go around opening bags</i>

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.670
<i>and surreptitiously rifling 
through the contents...</i>

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:07.460
<i>Right?</i>

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:12.050
<i>Which means that something must
 have triggered this change in her.</i>

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:10.180
Wh-What is it?

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.840
<i>But when?</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.560
<i>She was normal at the book signing.</i>

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:16.300
<i>But afterward...</i>

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:21.460
You had a meeting with your editor 
after the book signing, didn't you?

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.560
Did something happen?

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:27.810
Wh-Where's this coming from?
 Nothing much happened in the meeting.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:28.630
You...

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:30.960
Everyone, look out the window!

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:40.120
I can't wait to get there, Onii-chan.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:17.460
Episode Five: I Love My Little Sister More Than Anything in the World

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:15.770
Take that!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.580
Yay!

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.100
<i>A villa...</i>

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:30.830
<i>...and a private beach?</i>

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.350
<i>Just, wow, Mai.</i>

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:37.720
<i>She's acting all normal now, 
but something definitely happened.</i>

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.200
<i>Let's see... What could it have been?</i>

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.190
Why are you spacing out?

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:46.910
It looks like Himuro-san
 is still suspicious,

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:52.100
so we need to flirt in front of her some 
more to cast all doubt out of her mind.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:53.670
Get it together, will you?

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.170
Y-Yeah, I guess you're right.

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.840
I'm beat.

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:06.970
Sensei!

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.460
Since we're here at the beach,

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:12.950
I think we should gather 
material on a standard event!

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:15.310
"A standard event"?

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.320
Characters at a beach have 
to apply sunscreen, right?

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:24.240
Well, that <i>is</i> a staple 
fanservice scene, sure,

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:27.990
but do you usually apply sunscreen 
after you've been in the water?

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.560
That's neither here nor there, silly!

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:34.510
What's important is the act of 
massaging the sunscreen into the skin.

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:35.250
Oh, right.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:39.300
So, Sensei, if you'd be so kind.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.510
Huh? What do you want me to do?

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:45.010
Doesn't that go without saying?

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:48.180
I want you to rub that sunscreen into my skin.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.970
What?! What do you mean, 
you want <i>me</i> to rub it into your skin?

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.320
The template for this "event"

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:56.480
is a male character putting sunscreen on 
a female character while they flirt!

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:59.350
Well, okay, I guess that's true, but...

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:03.490
Besides, I've never had 
a man do it for me before,

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:07.490
so I want to use this opportunity 
to gather material for myself.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.870
You look like you've done it before.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:10.600
Huh?

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.560
Have you, Onii-chan?

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:15.000
S-Suzuka?!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.000
Well, have you or haven't you?

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.500
O-O-O-Of course I haven't!

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:23.820
Yes. Of course you haven't.

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:26.410
In that case, you need to 
experience it for your research.

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:27.060
Excuse me?

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.920
Of course, I'm the one who has 
to do it, since it's for your writing.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.770
It's my obligation as your little sister.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.430
Yuu's gonna put sunscreen on you?!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.960
I-I haven't experienced it, either,

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.270
so you're doing me, too!

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:41.020
I wanna get in on this, too!

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:44.200
Looks like we all want 
to do a sunscreen scene.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.280
We'll do rock-paper-scissors
 to decide who goes first.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:48.760
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:50.280
<i>Don't I get a choice?!</i>

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:59.460
A-Avert your eyes, will you?

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:03.960
Does this feel good, Onii-chan?

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:09.220
I'm doing you, too, huh?

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:11.000
Of course you are!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.720
Like I said just now, it's my 
obligation as your little sister!

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:18.460
Y-You don't need to take off your top!

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:20.270
All the other girls did,

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.060
so I will, too.

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:25.070
P-Please don't stare.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:34.580
I-I'm ready now.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.000
Th-Then, I'll get started.

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:46.570
Y-Yes, okay.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:57.930
<i>This is making my heart race more 
than when she usually makes noises.</i>

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:07.090
His hands move as though they're encouraging
 his little sister's sexuality to blossom.

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:08.440
Sometimes gentle...

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:10.950
Sometimes teasing...

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.020
They steadily map out her pleasure zones,

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.950
until finally, the petals of his 
little sister's bud burst open...

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:21.170
Why the hell are you adding 
that obscene narration?!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.340
Wh-Wh-What?

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:30.380
Sensei's "desire juices" have 
made his little sister wet!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.550
Please stop being so degenerate!

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:35.060
Suzuka-chan, use this.

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:36.900
Thank you very much.

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:40.100
But I'd just get it dirty. 
I'll go take a shower instead.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.840
Are you all right, Suzuka?

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:44.520
Onii-chan, what were you playing at?

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:45.580
Sorry.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.730
Mai, is it all right to use the shower?

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.530
Yeah, it's there if you want it.

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:53.530
Sorry. Thanks for letting me use it.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:59.500
<i>Did Suzuka forget to take 
a change of clothes with her?</i>

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:02.000
Excuse me. I'm going inside, too.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.770
Time for a "shower event"
for you and your little sister?

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:07.840
In that case, I'm coming, too! 
I'm also his little sister, after all!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:10.130
I'm just taking her something that she forgot!

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:12.980
Really? What a shame.

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:16.190
By the way, you should probably go 
take a shower, yourself, Sensei.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:18.390
You have sunscreen in your hair.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.940
Oh, you're right.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:23.890
Guess I should, then. Okay, 
I'll have one when Suzuka's finished.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:27.680
The villa's got a second shower, 
so why don't you just use that?

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:29.690
Huh? You have two showers?

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.400
I'll go do that, then.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:37.900
Hey, Suzuka. You forgot to take
a change of clothes with you, right?

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.900
Well, anyway, I'll leave your 
bag out here for you, okay?

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:50.990
Oh, this is the other one, huh?

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:52.460
I'll use this one—

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:58.540
Huh?

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:03.100
O-Onii-chan?

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.840
It's not what you think!

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:07.160
I d-d-d-d-didn't mean to walk in on you!

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:09.110
I thought you were using the other shower!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.530
Th-That one was broken.

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:14.560
No water was coming out, 
so I used this one instead.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.530
A-Anyway, forget that. How long 
do you plan on gawking at me?!

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:20.390
S-Sorry! I was gonna take a shower, too,

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:22.530
and I-I thought no one was in here...

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:26.500
Onii-chan, you're the worst.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.300
I'm sorry!

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:41.560
This festival's pretty big, isn't it?

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:43.930
I love festivals!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.840
Ow. It still hurts.

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:49.330
I get the feeling this has happened before...

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:51.900
<i>Yup, she's still mad.</i>

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:55.420
Onii-chan.

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:56.780
What is it?

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:01.160
I don't need anything in particular, but well...

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:03.950
Isn't there something you want to say to me?

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:08.220
Well, I'm <i>really</i> sorry about earlier.

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:09.670
Not about that!

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:12.130
What do you think?

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:14.590
About what?

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:19.550
Well, h-h-how do I look in this yukata?

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:20.510
Huh?

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:24.730
O-Oh, yeah. I think you look good.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.730
I-I see. Th-Thank you very much.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:33.510
Onii-chan told me I look good...

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:35.780
Hey!

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:38.780
What are you two whispering to each other?

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.740
Oh, nothing much.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.030
You're definitely hiding something, Yuu.

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:45.540
In that case...

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.220
I found something that looks delish!

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:49.540
Let's grab some, guys and gals!

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:08.280
It's almost time for the 
fireworks display, huh?

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:10.760
Oh, Yuu, over here.

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:11.730
Mai?

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:12.510
Huh?

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:14.690
Where are we going? 
What about Suzuka and the others?

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.480
They went on ahead to get us a spot 
to watch the fireworks display from.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:19.880
I'll show you where it is, so follow me.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:26.330
Hey, will we really be able to 
see the fireworks from here?

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:30.360
I've been waiting for this moment!

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:32.170
Y-You tricked me!

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.540
You're hiding something, Yuu.

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:37.460
It's something very important,

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.920
so it has to be Towano Chikai's "big secret."

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.630
I told you, I don't have any secrets!

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:45.610
I didn't think I'd get it 
out of you that easily...

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:50.850
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you doing?!

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:52.730
Isn't it obvious?!

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:53.980
I'm seducing you so you'll tell me!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:56.560
Should you really be telling me 
that <i>while</i> you're doing it?!

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:58.310
This is embarrassing for me, too,

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:01.610
so it'd be great if you could 
just spill the beans already!

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:03.570
You're still resisting me?

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:06.540
In that case, I'll use the direct approach!

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:09.110
Stop!

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:10.820
Why are you going this far?!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.890
Just how tightly are you 
guarding this secret?

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:18.260
You can fondle my boobs, 
or wherever else you want to,

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:19.760
so tell me your secret...

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:23.180
I just had a brain wave.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:24.840
And what might that be?

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:26.140
Yuu!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.180
You're going to write your 
manuscript in front of me!

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:33.980
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer
</b>

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:37.950
Well?

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:39.780
Impressive.

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:43.400
Towano Chikai's work is incredible.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:46.280
Even a single-scene 
excerpt is entertaining...

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.280
Are you done doubting me now?

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:52.860
<i>Thank goodness we saw this coming,</i>

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:57.500
<i>and I'd memorized the manuscript 
Suzuka was working on ahead of time.</i>

00:12:57.780 --> 00:13:00.610
But something feels off.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:01.960
O-Off?

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:06.090
I watched you the entire time 
you were writing this passage.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.850
The manuscript itself is perfect.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:13.370
But the way you were acting 
while writing it doesn't match up.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:19.480
Onii-chan always looks like 
that when he's writing.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.980
That bath felt great!

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:26.990
Hm? What's going on, guys and gals?

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:28.390
Well...

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:30.710
I imagine we're all tired 
after today's exploits,

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.210
so why don't we turn in?

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:34.110
Y-Yeah!

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:35.370
Let's do that!

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:36.750
Sure, okay.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.340
It's a little early, but let's 
call it a day and go to bed.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:43.090
There are only four beds.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.260
I see!

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:47.000
Then, let's decide who 
gets to sleep with Sensei!

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.440
How does that make sense?!

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:51.910
There's no point to events like this 
if there isn't a male-female pairing.

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:54.020
Okay, how about strip 
rock-paper-scissors to decide?

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:54.810
I'll do it!

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.310
I'll sleep with Onii-chan!

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.310
Suzuka?

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.370
It's not proper for a man 
and a woman to share a bed.

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.320
But I'm his little sister,

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:07.320
so I don't mind sleeping in his bed.

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:09.820
You're okay with that, right, Onii-chan?

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:13.560
Yeah. I don't mind sharing with you, Suzuka.

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:16.330
<i>It's the only real option 
if we want to convince Mai.</i>

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:19.180
Then, I guess we'll do that.

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:22.090
Mai. Minazuki-san. 
Are you two okay with that?

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:23.280
Yes!

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:26.090
Well, it <i>does</i> seem like 
the most reasonable option.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:29.090
Th-Then, let's go, Onii-chan.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:38.770
<i>I can't sleep.</i>

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.400
Onii-chan...

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.170
<i>Th-This is bad!</i>

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:53.660
That's not allowed, Onii-chan...

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.330
Y-You!

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:56.950
Onii-chan...

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:01.750
U-Um, c-could you wake up, Suzuka-san?

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:04.210
Oh, we can't do that...

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.680
I finally escaped.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:16.180
I'll go sleep in the living room.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.180
Hm?

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:19.290
Mai?

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.340
What are you doing out here?

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:26.190
Oh, nothing much.

00:15:30.230 --> 00:15:32.200
Hey, has something happened?

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:36.200
I've had a change of editor recently.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.150
They're pretty blunt with their feedback.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:42.760
My works are able to 
convey a sense of danger

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:44.860
because of the love 
I imbue them with, but...

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:45.710
"A sense of danger"?

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:49.930
My current series has been 
green-lit as an anime,

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.400
but my popularity's waning.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:51.970
Huh?

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:53.590
He was frank.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:56.570
"Enryuu Homura-sensei," he said, 
"the characters in your work,

00:15:56.570 --> 00:16:00.740
especially your protagonist,
 are extremely weak."

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:05.500
At this rate, my series might get canceled.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:11.280
So Yuu, please, tell me 
what it is you're hiding!

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.990
I'm certain your secret is 
the answer I'm looking for!

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:15.990
That's...

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:19.490
I know I'm asking a lot of you, but please!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:20.960
C-Calm down.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:23.100
You're Towano Chikai, aren't you?

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:26.380
Or are you not really 
Towano Chikai, after all?

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:30.940
Huh? Yuu?

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:33.070
Wh-Why aren't you saying anything?

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:35.700
Do you mean to tell me...

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:36.890
I, uh...

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:39.220
Forget it!

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:40.350
Jerk!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:43.670
I've really done it now.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:46.270
<i>No, I have to keep calm.</i>

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.920
<i>I've found out what's troubling Mai.</i>

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:50.820
<i>So once I've solved her issue, 
all this should settle down.</i>

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:52.550
<i>But how do I solve it?</i>

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:55.320
<i>I'll try asking Suzuka.</i>

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:05.250
Onii-chan, where did you go, hm?

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:07.260
I was just talking to Mai.

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:09.000
Are you annoyed with me?

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.810
Yes, I'm annoyed with you.

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:14.560
I can't believe you slipped off for a little 
tryst with Himuro-san while I slept.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:16.930
I'm sorry, but I need to ask 
you something right away.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.010
What? Don't just brush me off like that!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:22.770
Suzuka, how do you write 
your main character, Ryou?

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:25.270
Huh? What's this, all of a sudden?

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:27.160
It's important. Please, just answer.

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.170
I don't really know, though.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:32.400
When I write my novels, 
I feel like I'm possessed.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.640
What do you mean by "possessed"?

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:36.400
Uh, well...

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.420
I can't describe it very well,

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:42.140
but it feels like something's possessing me,

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:45.560
or like, I'm <i>becoming</i> my character.

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:47.540
<i>Becoming... your character?</i>

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:52.030
<i>Have I ever truly "become" 
one of my characters before?</i>

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:54.920
<i>Let alone, so strongly that it felt 
like the character was possessing me...</i>

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.020
Onii-chan?

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:59.550
<i>No, I haven't.</i>

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:01.690
<i>Then, I'll give it a try!</i>

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:02.960
<i>Trace it.</i>

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:05.060
<i>Become the perfect brother 
from Suzuka's novels!</i>

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:09.260
Onii-chan?

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:10.030
Suzuka.

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:13.480
Y-Yes? What's going on? 
You suddenly fell silent.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:16.490
A-A-Also, you're kinda close to me right now.

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.480
Thanks to you, Suzuka, 
I've realized something important.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.100
Wh-Wh-What's gotten into you?

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:29.340
I can say it to you now.

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:32.350
I love you more than anything in the world.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.890
You l-l-l-l-love me?!

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:40.850
<i>I get it now.</i>

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:42.870
<i>Becoming the main character in the series...</i>

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:45.560
<i>...is no different from 
becoming the author in real life.</i>

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:49.310
<i>I've never actually fully 
become Towano Chikai before.</i>

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:50.380
Right!

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.460
Mai! Are you awake?!

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:57.030
Huh?

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:58.740
H-Huh?!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.240
Why are you barging in like this?

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:06.650
I'm going to make an exception 
and teach you Towano Chikai's secret.

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:07.500
H-Huh?

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.210
What's going on?

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:12.170
It's the secret you've 
wanted to know for so long.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:18.260
What you lack right now is the ability 
to <i>become</i> your character as you write!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.520
Huh? What?

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:21.040
What are you saying?

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:22.680
I already do that—

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:24.310
No, you don't.

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:28.440
Listen, it's not so easy to 
just become your character.

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:30.980
That manuscript you saw in 
the classroom is proof of that.

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:31.560
Huh?

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:34.320
Th-That's what that was?

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.180
Yes.

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:39.690
I carry around my failed manuscripts 
as a reminder to myself.

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:42.200
But... what you're talking about...

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:45.140
There are different levels of 
becoming the character you're writing.

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:47.800
You need to completely inhabit the person.

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:49.450
That's your job as a professional writer!

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:51.380
A professional writer...

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:53.680
I believe you are capable of doing it.

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:56.960
I want to see how your series continues!

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.670
M-My series?

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:00.420
Yeah.

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:03.180
I love the novels you write!

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:07.680
All right. I'll do it.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.680
Become my main character, huh?

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:12.690
Bring it on!

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:14.780
I'll inhabit my characters completely!

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:17.190
I won't let him call them weak ever again!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.370
Hey...

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:29.160
Thanks for saying you love my novels, Yuu.

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:35.580
Welcome back.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.750
Did you hear all that?

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:41.560
You were so loud, I could 
hear you from in here.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:44.180
Well, not that I'm worried, you understand.

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:48.760
Y-You just said you love me more 
than anything in the world, after all.

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:51.600
U-Uh, yeah...

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:53.690
Oh, right.

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:58.610
You're starting on your 
manuscript this late at night?

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:02.640
If I don't work hard, too, 
I won't be able to face Mai.

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:05.260
Oh, sorry. You wanted to 
get some shuteye, didn't you?

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:06.520
I'll go into the living room.

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:08.200
No, don't worry about it.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:11.100
I'm going to do some writing now, too.

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:11.820
Huh?

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:13.960
I thought you already 
finished your next manuscript...

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:18.110
I still need to put the research 
we've done here to good use.

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:20.040
That's true, but...

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.710
Why are you sitting next to me?

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:24.470
Because I want to be near you, Onii-chan.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:25.470
Huh?

00:21:25.780 --> 00:21:28.260
I'm about to start writing 
a tale of a little sister

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.760
who loves her brother too much, you know?

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:35.450
So isn't it natural to want to sit next to my 
brother to help me inhabit my character?

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:37.250
Yeah, you have a point.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.280
Hey, Suzuka.

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:50.830
Thank you.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:39.980
Illustration: CUTEG

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:27.440
Yes, hello! Esaka-san here!

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:28.440
And Sakura, too!

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:29.860
We're finally doing a proper one of these.

00:23:29.860 --> 00:23:31.310
Yes, we are, Onee-chan!

00:23:31.310 --> 00:23:32.150
Huh?

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:33.160
Onee-chan?

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:34.760
When I did become your big sister?

